{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":8},"Les Blagues de Toto 2 - Classe verte","Toto et ses camarades sont de retour, direction la campagne pour une classe verte ! Mais, si pour les autres élèves, celle-ci est l’occasion de découvrir la vie à la ferme, pour Toto, c’est surtout l’opportunité parfaite pour inventer de nouvelles blagues et vivre de folles aventures. D’autant que les fermiers qui les accueillent ont l’air un peu louches, et qu’on raconte qu’un fantôme rode dans le coin… Toto compte bien mener l’enquête, et il a plus d’un tour dans son sac !",[4,5,6,7],"state institutions","fatherhood","low rank employment","rural",{"type":9,"id":10,"slug":11,"title":12,"release":14,"filmType":18,"directors":19,"genre":27,"media":30,"synopsis":33,"production":34,"characters":40,"roles":41,"awards":79,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_148","fr2023-148-les-blagues-de-toto-2-classe-verte",{"native":1,"english":13},"",{"type":15,"date":16,"year":17},"Theatrical release","2023-08-02",2023,"Fiction film",[20],{"id":21,"slug":22,"name":21,"birthYear":23,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":26},"Pascal Bourdiaux","pascal-bourdiaux",0,"Male identifying","France",[],[28,29],"Comedy","Children's Film",{"posterUrl":31,"trailerUrl":32},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/165/22/267941/format_page/les-blagues-de-toto-2-classe-verte.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jyHALVNHV2Q",{"native":2,"english":13},[35,37],{"country":25,"share":36},"Majority coproducer",{"country":38,"share":39},"Belgium","Minority coproducer",[],[42,49,56,63,69,73],{"person":43,"role":48},{"id":44,"slug":45,"name":44,"birthYear":46,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":47},"Arsène Mosca","arsene-mosca",1967,[],"Minor actor/Cameo",{"person":50,"role":55},{"id":51,"slug":52,"name":51,"birthYear":53,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":54},"Guillaume de Tonquédec","guillaume-de-tonquedec",1966,[],"Supporting actor",{"pe